# PR draft → ready

Create PRs as **Draft** by default. **Ready for review** only when title, description, embedded media, and acceptance review match **shipped code and the latest demo**.

Follow **[obsidian-pr-ship-sync](../skills/obsidian-pr-ship-sync/SKILL.md)** in the same turn as demo completion:

1. **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** — full body + artifacts + acceptance evidence.
2. **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** — **`draft: false`** only after step 1.

Do not mark Ready with stale copy (e.g. “live wave” after level bars) or PASS tied to old clips.

**Related:** [pr-product-demos](../.cursor/rules/pr-product-demos.mdc), [obsidian-cloud-vm-demos](../skills/obsidian-cloud-vm-demos/SKILL.md), [obsidian-pr-acceptance-review](../skills/obsidian-pr-acceptance-review/SKILL.md).
